### Assignment dialog

Make the driver-assigned modal responsive, compact, and easy to dismiss. It must show actual driver details and remain consistent with the active ride screen.

### Tablet and desktop

On wider screens, use balanced two-column layouts when useful. Do not simply stretch mobile cards to enormous widths.

Maintain a clear visual hierarchy and a consistent brand system across all breakpoints.

